t between Yuan Shao and Gongsun Zan for Ji Province, he was sent as an envoy to Yuan Shao. Yuan Shao feigned agreement to cede territory in Ji Province, but on Gongsun Yue's return journey, he arranged for his men to disguise themselves as Dong Zhuo's soldiers and shoot him dead.","jp":"公孫瓚の弟。袁紹と公孫瓚が冀州を争った初期、使者として袁紹を訪ねる。袁紹は冀州の領土を割譲すると偽って承諾したが、公孫越の帰途、手下に董卓の兵を装わせて射殺させた。","kr":"공손찬의 아우입니다. 원소와 공손찬이 기주를 두고 다투던 초기에 사신으로 원소를 방문했습니다. 원소는 기주의 영토를 나누어 주겠다고 거짓으로 응했으나, 공손월이 돌아가는 길에 부하를 동탁의 군사로 위장시켜 사살했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"3","year":"191","reason":{"zh":"在<诸侯讨董>后续剧情中存在死亡结局","tc":"在<諸侯討董>后續劇情中存在死亡結局","en":"Has a death ending in the subsequent <Lords' Campaign Against Dong Zhuo> storyline","jp":"<諸侯討董>の後続シナリオに死亡結末が存在する","kr":"<제후토동> 후속 스토리에서 사망 결말이 존재합니다."}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10306","remark":"","surname":"公孙","surnameTc":"公孫","surnameEn":"Gongsun","surnameJp":"公孫","surnameKr":"공손","surnameOther":"","name":"越","nameTc":"越","nameEn":"Yue","nameJp":"越","nameKr":"월","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"公孙越","power":"WJ10065","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1007","gender":"0","rule":"74","force":"72","wise":"47","politics":"54","charm":"67","will":"50","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"74/30/30/30/30/15/50/30","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1002205","battleSoul":"1005705","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5400","battleSoulPoint":"5100","debateSoulPoint":"2200","strategy":"1000308","strategy2":"1000905","professions":"0/2/4/0/2/0/2/1/0/1/2/2/2/2/2/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"43","loyalty":"120","reputation":"5200","evaluate":"0","title":"",